<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-AMSTERDAM OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMSTERDAM OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-finals</p>
<p>at the Amsterdam Open men's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat 6-Javier Sanchez (Spain) 7-6 (7-5) 6-1</p>
<p>Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat John van Lottum (Netherlands) 6-4 4-6 6-2.</p>
<p>Remaining quarter-finals play Friday.</p>
</text>
